        "Type": "usercreated",
        "Title": "Melon Slice/メロンの切り目",
        "Location": "LOCATION_NORTHSEA",
        "PublicId": "121992078416",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/theark/scene_magpie.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository f257bd7e-8b93-460e-8a6a-e04f34cd66b2).Image",
        "Description": "I visit my boyfriend&apos;s apartment all the time,but somehow he&apos;s always out.So I let myself in with the spare key,sliced up a melon,and left it in the fridge for him.He threw it away without even eating it!I even made him a salad...He threw that away too!...Hehe.Die.\r[JPN]\r彼氏のアパートに遊びに行ったら、いつの日も彼は留守。スペアキーで無断侵入してメロンに切り目を入れて冷蔵庫に入れておいたら、食べずに捨てられました！サラダも作ってみたのですがそっちも捨てられました！ころちゅ。",
        "GameVersion": "8.24.0.0",
